{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03127","headline":"酬宋使君见诒 · 张九龄","name":"酬宋使君见诒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陟邻初禀训，献策幸逢时。\n朝列且云忝，君恩复若兹。\n庭闱际海曲，轺传荷天慈。\n顾己欢乌鸟，闻君泣素丝。\n才明应主召，福善岂神欺。\n但愿白心在，终然湼不淄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}